#: helpers/plugnmeet-help-texts.php:48
msgid ""
"Enables a collaborative text editor where participants and moderators can "
"take real-time notes together. This is perfect for brainstorming, co-writing,"
" or building a shared summary."
msgstr ""

#: helpers/plugnmeet-help-texts.php:41
msgid ""
"Enables moderators to broadcast the live session to external platforms like "
"YouTube, Facebook, or Twitch. Perfect for public webinars or guest lectures."
msgstr ""

#: helpers/plugnmeet-help-texts.php:71
msgid ""
"Enables moderators to create interactive polls and quick quizzes during the "
"session. This is a great way to check participant understanding and increase "
"engagement."
msgstr ""

#: helpers/plugnmeet-help-texts.php:61
msgid ""
"Enables moderators to split participants into smaller groups for focused "
"discussions, collaborative projects, or private group activities."
msgstr ""

#: helpers/plugnmeet-help-texts.php:28
msgid ""
"Enables participants to blur their background or use a virtual image. Great "
"for maintaining privacy and ensuring a professional appearance."
msgstr ""

#: helpers/plugnmeet-help-texts.php:86
msgid ""
"Enables real-time speech-to-text during the session. This must be enabled "
"for transcription translation or speech synthesis (TTS) to work."
msgstr ""

#: helpers/plugnmeet-help-texts.php:89
msgid ""
"Enables real-time translation of chat messages, allowing participants to "
"communicate instantly across different languages."
msgstr ""

#: helpers/plugnmeet-help-texts.php:35
msgid ""
"Enables recording on the PlugNmeet server. The final video is processed and "
"stored in the cloud, making it easy to share via a link once the session "
"ends."
msgstr ""

#: helpers/plugnmeet-help-texts.php:88
msgid ""
"Enables Text-to-Speech, allowing the live transcript to be read aloud for "
"better accessibility and for visually impaired participants."
msgstr ""

