#: helpers/plugnmeet-help-texts.php:102
msgid ""
"What this AI session is about, in 200 characters or less. The agent uses it "
"to keep the conversation on topic and to remind participants what the "
"session is for."
msgstr ""

#: helpers/plugnmeet-help-texts.php:107
msgid ""
"When enabled, the AI agent only answers within the allowed subtopics and "
"declines requests that fall outside them. When disabled, it can follow the "
"participant but reminds them of the session topic."
msgstr ""

#: helpers/plugnmeet-help-texts.php:178
msgid ""
"When enabled, the microphone track is fully stopped while muted instead of "
"just being silenced, so no audio data is sent while muted."
msgstr ""

#: helpers/plugnmeet-help-texts.php:26
msgid ""
"When enabled, the session will not start and no one can join until a "
"moderator joins first. Participants will remain on the page and will not "
"enter the room or a waiting area. This is different from the Waiting Room "
"option, where users can still join and wait."
msgstr ""

#: helpers/plugnmeet-help-texts.php:31
msgid ""
"When enabled, the system creates a new ID for each join so the same user can "
"join from multiple devices, for example from a tablet to draw on the "
"whiteboard while using a PC for the camera and microphone. When disabled, "
"the system uses the WordPress user ID for logged-in users and auto-generates "
"an ID based on the session ID for users who are not logged in. It is "
"recommended to keep this off so duplicate joins are prevented."
msgstr ""

#: helpers/plugnmeet-help-texts.php:223
msgid ""
"Where the tools of MCP server %d are available: AI agent only, AI text chat "
"only, or shared between both."
msgstr ""

